{"schema_version":1,"attribution":{"text":"出典：法務省ウェブサイト（https://www.moj.go.jp/jinji/shihoushiken/）","source_pdfs":["https://www.moj.go.jp/content/001399906.pdf","https://www.moj.go.jp/content/001400884.pdf"],"note":"法務省が公開する試験問題・正解の PDF から、このプロジェクトがテキストを抽出し、構造化・編集・加工したもの。法務省が作成したものではない。肢ごとの○×は公式の解答から導出したもの。"},"exam":{"type":"yobi","year":2023,"era":"R05"},"subject":"keiho","generated_by":"pipeline/derive.py","questions":[{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q01","exam":{"type":"yobi","year":2023,"era":"R05"},"subject":"keiho","number":1,"points":2,"format":"count","polarity":"incorrect","exhaustive":false,"unordered":false,"stem":"暴行罪及び傷害罪に関する次のアからオまでの各記述を判例の立場に従って検討した場合、誤っているものの個数を後記１から５までの中から選びなさい。（解答欄は、［№１］）","context":[],"sub_questions":[],"requires_context":false,"choices":[{"number":1,"text":"１個","count":1},{"number":2,"text":"２個","count":2},{"number":3,"text":"３個","count":3},{"number":4,"text":"４個","count":4},{"number":5,"text":"５個","count":5}],"answer_slots":[{"no":1,"official_answer":4}],"scoring":{"partial_credit":null,"no_partial_credit":false,"raw_note":""},"status":{"voided":false,"all_correct":false,"errata":[]},"statements":["yobi-2023-keiho-q01-a","yobi-2023-keiho-q01-b","yobi-2023-keiho-q01-c","yobi-2023-keiho-q01-d","yobi-2023-keiho-q01-e"],"statement_truth_derivable":false,"provenance":{"question_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_問題.pdf","answer_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_正答.pdf","page":2,"line_range":[11,28],"extraction":"pdftotext"},"flags":[]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q02","exam":{"type":"yobi","year":2023,"era":"R05"},"subject":"keiho","number":2,"points":3,"format":"multi_select_unordered","polarity":"incorrect","exhaustive":false,"unordered":true,"stem":"次の【判旨】に関する後記１から５までの各【記述】のうち、誤っているものを２個選びなさい。（解答欄は、［№２］、［№３］順不同）","context":[{"kind":"判旨","text":"共謀共同正犯が成立するには、二人以上の者が、特定の犯罪を行うため、共同意思の下に一体となって互いに他人の行為を利用し、各自の意思を実行に移すことを内容とする謀議をなし、よって犯罪を実行した事実が認められなければならない。したがって、このような関係において共謀に参加した事実が認められる以上、直接実行行為に関与しない者でも、他人の行為をいわば自己の手段として犯罪を行ったという意味において、その間刑責の成立に差異を生ずると解すべき理由はない。さればこの関係において実行行為に直接関与したかどうか、その分担又は役割のいかんは、共犯の刑責自体の成立を左右するものではないと解する。"}],"sub_questions":[],"requires_context":true,"choices":[],"answer_slots":[{"no":2,"official_answer":1},{"no":3,"official_answer":5}],"scoring":{"partial_credit":null,"no_partial_credit":true,"raw_note":"順不同(部分点なし)"},"status":{"voided":false,"all_correct":false,"errata":[]},"statements":["yobi-2023-keiho-q02-1","yobi-2023-keiho-q02-2","yobi-2023-keiho-q02-3","yobi-2023-keiho-q02-4","yobi-2023-keiho-q02-5"],"statement_truth_derivable":true,"provenance":{"question_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_問題.pdf","answer_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_正答.pdf","page":2,"line_range":[29,53],"extraction":"pdftotext"},"flags":[]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q03","exam":{"type":"yobi","year":2023,"era":"R05"},"subject":"keiho","number":3,"points":2,"format":"fill_blank","polarity":null,"exhaustive":false,"unordered":false,"stem":"学生Ａ及びＢは、次の【事例】における甲の罪責について、後記【会話】のとおり議論している。【会話】中の①から⑤までの（ ）内から適切な語句を選んだ場合、正しいものの組合せは、後記１から５までのうちどれか。（解答欄は、［№４］）","context":[{"kind":"事例","text":"甲は、Ｘ県から代金１億円で請け負った土木工事を完成させ、同工事で生じた汚泥５トンを搬出して適法に処理した。上記工事に関する請負契約では、甲が工事で生じた汚泥を全て搬出することが義務付けられていたが、請負代金はその搬出量にかかわらず定額とされ、汚泥の処理方法についての定めもなかった。もっとも、上記契約締結の際、Ｘ県が汚泥搬出量は５０トンを下らないと予測していたため、甲は、実際の搬出量を報告すれば、Ｘ県が行う工事完成検査の際に不法投棄を疑われ、その調査のために請負代金の支払が延期されると懸念し、Ｘ県に対し、汚泥５０トンを搬出して適法に処理したと虚偽の報告をし、Ｘ県職員をその旨誤信させ、請負代金１億円の支払を受けた。なお、甲が虚偽の報告をしなければ、Ｘ県が不法投棄について調査を行い、請負代金の支払時期が遅れたことは確実であった。"},{"kind":"会話","text":"学生Ａ．詐欺罪の成否を問題とした場合、財産上の損害をどう考えますか。\n学生Ｂ．詐欺罪における財産上の損害の有無は、①（ａ．財物の占有・支配の喪失それ自体によって・ｂ．被害者の取引目的達成の有無も考慮して）判断すべきです。本事例では、請負契約の目的である工事が完成し、かつ、その請負代金は定額なので、Ｘ県に財産上の損害はないと考えます。\n学生Ａ．Ｂさんのように、財産上の損害を実質的に把握するとしても、本事例では、②（ｃ．Ｘ県の代金支払時期を早めた・ｄ．Ｘ県の代金減額請求権を侵害した）という点で、財産上の損害を認め得ると思います。\n学生Ｂ．Ａさんの見解では、③（ｅ．一日でも支払時期を早めれば詐欺罪が成立する・ｆ．未成年であることを秘して成人向け雑誌を購入した者にまで詐欺罪が成立する）ことになりかねず、妥当でないと考えます。\n学生Ａ．いや、私は、判例と同様に、④（ｇ．全体財産の減少が認められる・ｈ．社会通念上別個の支払に当たるといい得る程度の期間、支払時期を早めた）場合に限って財産上の損害を認めますので、その批判は当たりません。ところで、Ｂさんは、本事例において、詐欺未遂罪の成立も否定しますか。\n学生Ｂ．甲の虚偽報告の有無にかかわらずＸ県は代金を支払わざるを得ませんので、そもそも、\n⑤（ｉ．欺罔行為がない・ｊ．財物の交付行為がない）と考えます。したがって、詐欺未遂罪も成立しません。"}],"sub_questions":[],"requires_context":true,"choices":[{"number":1,"text":"①ａ ③ｅ ⑤ｉ","blanks":[{"blank":1,"word":"ａ"},{"blank":3,"word":"ｅ"},{"blank":5,"word":"ｉ"}]},{"number":2,"text":"①ｂ ②ｃ ④ｇ","blanks":[{"blank":1,"word":"ｂ"},{"blank":2,"word":"ｃ"},{"blank":4,"word":"ｇ"}]},{"number":3,"text":"①ｂ ④ｈ ⑤ｉ","blanks":[{"blank":1,"word":"ｂ"},{"blank":4,"word":"ｈ"},{"blank":5,"word":"ｉ"}]},{"number":4,"text":"②ｃ ③ｆ ④ｇ","blanks":[{"blank":2,"word":"ｃ"},{"blank":3,"word":"ｆ"},{"blank":4,"word":"ｇ"}]},{"number":5,"text":"②ｄ ③ｅ ⑤ｊ","blanks":[{"blank":2,"word":"ｄ"},{"blank":3,"word":"ｅ"},{"blank":5,"word":"ｊ"}]}],"answer_slots":[{"no":4,"official_answer":3}],"scoring":{"partial_credit":null,"no_partial_credit":false,"raw_note":""},"status":{"voided":false,"all_correct":false,"errata":[]},"statements":[],"statement_truth_derivable":false,"provenance":{"question_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_問題.pdf","answer_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_正答.pdf","page":3,"line_range":[55,96],"extraction":"pdftotext"},"flags":[]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q04","exam":{"type":"yobi","year":2023,"era":"R05"},"subject":"keiho","number":4,"points":2,"format":"single_choice","polarity":"incorrect","exhaustive":false,"unordered":false,"stem":"強盗の罪に関する次の１から５までの各記述を判例の立場に従って検討した場合、誤っているものはどれか。（解答欄は、［№５］）","context":[],"sub_questions":[],"requires_context":false,"choices":[],"answer_slots":[{"no":5,"official_answer":2}],"scoring":{"partial_credit":null,"no_partial_credit":false,"raw_note":""},"status":{"voided":false,"all_correct":false,"errata":[]},"statements":["yobi-2023-keiho-q04-1","yobi-2023-keiho-q04-2","yobi-2023-keiho-q04-3","yobi-2023-keiho-q04-4","yobi-2023-keiho-q04-5"],"statement_truth_derivable":true,"provenance":{"question_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_問題.pdf","answer_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_正答.pdf","page":4,"line_range":[98,115],"extraction":"pdftotext"},"flags":[]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q05","exam":{"type":"yobi","year":2023,"era":"R05"},"subject":"keiho","number":5,"points":2,"format":"combination","polarity":"correct","exhaustive":false,"unordered":false,"stem":"緊急避難に関する次のアからオまでの各記述を判例の立場に従って検討した場合、正しいものの組合せは、後記１から５までのうちどれか。（解答欄は、［№６］）","context":[],"sub_questions":[],"requires_context":false,"choices":[{"number":1,"text":"ア エ","labels":["ア","エ"]},{"number":2,"text":"ア オ","labels":["ア","オ"]},{"number":3,"text":"イ ウ","labels":["イ","ウ"]},{"number":4,"text":"イ エ","labels":["イ","エ"]},{"number":5,"text":"ウ オ","labels":["ウ","オ"]}],"answer_slots":[{"no":6,"official_answer":3}],"scoring":{"partial_credit":null,"no_partial_credit":false,"raw_note":""},"status":{"voided":false,"all_correct":false,"errata":[]},"statements":["yobi-2023-keiho-q05-a","yobi-2023-keiho-q05-b","yobi-2023-keiho-q05-c","yobi-2023-keiho-q05-d","yobi-2023-keiho-q05-e"],"statement_truth_derivable":true,"provenance":{"question_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_問題.pdf","answer_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_正答.pdf","page":4,"line_range":[116,134],"extraction":"pdftotext"},"flags":[]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q06","exam":{"type":"yobi","year":2023,"era":"R05"},"subject":"keiho","number":6,"points":3,"format":"multi_select_unordered","polarity":"correct","exhaustive":false,"unordered":true,"stem":"放火の罪に関する次の１から５までの各記述を判例の立場に従って検討した場合、正しいものを２個選びなさい。（解答欄は、［№７］、［№８］順不同）","context":[],"sub_questions":[],"requires_context":false,"choices":[],"answer_slots":[{"no":7,"official_answer":3},{"no":8,"official_answer":4}],"scoring":{"partial_credit":null,"no_partial_credit":true,"raw_note":"順不同(部分点なし)"},"status":{"voided":false,"all_correct":false,"errata":[]},"statements":["yobi-2023-keiho-q06-1","yobi-2023-keiho-q06-2","yobi-2023-keiho-q06-3","yobi-2023-keiho-q06-4","yobi-2023-keiho-q06-5"],"statement_truth_derivable":true,"provenance":{"question_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_問題.pdf","answer_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_正答.pdf","page":5,"line_range":[136,159],"extraction":"pdftotext"},"flags":[]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q07","exam":{"type":"yobi","year":2023,"era":"R05"},"subject":"keiho","number":7,"points":2,"format":"fill_blank","polarity":null,"exhaustive":false,"unordered":false,"stem":"共犯の要素従属性に関して、学生Ａ及びＢが次の【会話】のとおり議論している。【会話】中の①から⑥までの（ ）内に後記【語句群】から適切な語句を入れた場合、正しいものの組合せは、後記１から５までのうちどれか。なお、①から⑥までの（ ）内にはそれぞれ異なる語句が入る。（解答欄は、［№９］）","context":[{"kind":"会話","text":"学生Ａ．（①）ことからも、共犯を処罰するためには、正犯が（②）を備える必要があると考えます。\n学生Ｂ．Ａさんの見解によれば、甲が乙に指示して構成要件に該当する行為を実行させたが、（③）において、甲に責任を問うことができなくなり、不当ではありませんか。\n学生Ａ．その場合、甲に（④）を幅広く認めることで妥当な結論を得られます。\n学生Ｂ．でも、乙が刑事未成年者ながら是非弁別能力があり、その意思が抑圧されていない場合にまで（④）を認めることは無理がありますね。他方で、適法な行為を援助する行為を処罰の対象とするのは妥当ではありません。私は、（⑤）べきと考えるので、共犯を処罰するためには、正犯が（⑥）を備えることが必要であり、それで足りることになります。"},{"kind":"語句群","text":"ａ．違法は連帯的に作用するが、責任は個別的に作用する\nｂ．教唆犯については刑法第６１条が「犯罪」という文言を使っている\nｃ．違法性阻却事由については、行為者ごとの違法の相対性も認められる\nｄ．構成要件該当性\nｅ．構成要件該当性及び違法性\nｆ．構成要件該当性、違法性及び有責性\nｇ．乙の行為に違法性阻却事由が認められる事案\nｈ．乙の行為に責任阻却事由が認められる事案\nｉ．間接正犯\nｊ．幇助犯"}],"sub_questions":[],"requires_context":true,"choices":[{"number":1,"text":"①ａ ③ｇ ⑤ｃ","blanks":[{"blank":1,"word":"ａ"},{"blank":3,"word":"ｇ"},{"blank":5,"word":"ｃ"}]},{"number":2,"text":"①ｂ ③ｈ ⑤ｃ","blanks":[{"blank":1,"word":"ｂ"},{"blank":3,"word":"ｈ"},{"blank":5,"word":"ｃ"}]},{"number":3,"text":"①ｃ ④ｉ ⑤ａ","blanks":[{"blank":1,"word":"ｃ"},{"blank":4,"word":"ｉ"},{"blank":5,"word":"ａ"}]},{"number":4,"text":"②ｄ ④ｊ ⑥ｆ","blanks":[{"blank":2,"word":"ｄ"},{"blank":4,"word":"ｊ"},{"blank":6,"word":"ｆ"}]},{"number":5,"text":"②ｆ ④ｉ ⑥ｅ","blanks":[{"blank":2,"word":"ｆ"},{"blank":4,"word":"ｉ"},{"blank":6,"word":"ｅ"}]}],"answer_slots":[{"no":9,"official_answer":5}],"scoring":{"partial_credit":null,"no_partial_credit":false,"raw_note":""},"status":{"voided":false,"all_correct":false,"errata":[]},"statements":[],"statement_truth_derivable":false,"provenance":{"question_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_問題.pdf","answer_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_正答.pdf","page":6,"line_range":[161,193],"extraction":"pdftotext"},"flags":[]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q08","exam":{"type":"yobi","year":2023,"era":"R05"},"subject":"keiho","number":8,"points":2,"format":"single_choice","polarity":"correct","exhaustive":false,"unordered":false,"stem":"賭博の罪に関する次の１から５までの各記述を判例の立場に従って検討した場合、正しいものはどれか。（解答欄は、［№10］）","context":[{"kind":"参照条文","text":"刑法と\n第１８５条 賭博をした者は、５０万円以下の罰金又は科料に処する。ただし、一時の娯楽に供かする物を賭けたにとどまるときは、この限りでない。\n第１８６条 常習として賭博をした者は、３年以下の懲役に処する。２ 賭博場を開張し、又は博徒を結合して利益を図った者は、３月以上５年以下の懲役に処する。"}],"sub_questions":[],"requires_context":true,"choices":[],"answer_slots":[{"no":10,"official_answer":3}],"scoring":{"partial_credit":null,"no_partial_credit":false,"raw_note":""},"status":{"voided":false,"all_correct":false,"errata":[]},"statements":["yobi-2023-keiho-q08-1","yobi-2023-keiho-q08-2","yobi-2023-keiho-q08-3","yobi-2023-keiho-q08-4","yobi-2023-keiho-q08-5"],"statement_truth_derivable":true,"provenance":{"question_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_問題.pdf","answer_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_正答.pdf","page":7,"line_range":[195,221],"extraction":"pdftotext"},"flags":[]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q09","exam":{"type":"yobi","year":2023,"era":"R05"},"subject":"keiho","number":9,"points":2,"format":"fill_blank","polarity":null,"exhaustive":false,"unordered":false,"stem":"学生Ａ及びＢは、次の【事例】における甲の罪責について、後記【会話】のとおり議論している。【会話】中の①から⑤までの（ ）内に後記【語句群】から適切な語句を入れた場合、正しいものの組合せは、後記１から５までのうちどれか。なお、①から⑤までの（ ）内にはそれぞれ異なる語句が入る。（解答欄は、［№11］）","context":[{"kind":"事例","text":"甲は、殺意をもって、Ｘの腕の静脈内に蒸留水と空気を注射したが、当該空気量が疾病のない健常人に対する致死量未満であったためＸは死ななかった。また、甲は、当該空気量が上記致死量未満とは知らなかった。なお、当該空気量であっても被注射者の身体的条件等によっては死亡する危険はあった。"},{"kind":"会話","text":"学生Ａ．未遂犯と不能犯の区別に関してはいろいろな考え方がありますが、行為の時点において一般人が認識し得た事情と行為者が特に知っていた事情を基礎とし、一般人が結果発生の危険を感じる場合には可罰的未遂を肯定する考え方に立ち、本事例では一般人が結果発生の危険を感じるとすれば、甲に殺人未遂罪が（①）ことになりますね。\n学生Ｂ．この考え方に対しては、（②）ことになるという批判がありますね。では、結果発生の危険性を事後的客観的に判断する考え方に立った場合、甲の罪責をどう考えますか。\n学生Ａ．（③）という考え方によれば、身体的条件等によっては死亡の危険があったので、甲に殺人未遂罪が成立します。一方で、結果発生の危険性を事後的客観的に判断する考え方を徹底すれば、（④）ことになりませんか。\n学生Ｂ．そうとは限りませんよ。結果が発生しなかった原因究明と同時に、いかなる事情があれば結果発生があり得たかを明らかにし、（⑤）可能性を判断すれば妥当な結論を導けます。"},{"kind":"語句群","text":"ａ．成立する\nｂ．成立しない\nｃ．迷信犯に未遂犯を認める\nｄ．印象で未遂犯処罰を決める\nｅ．行為者の認識内容が客観的真実に合致するか否かによって区別する\nｆ．結果発生の絶対的不能・相対的不能によって区別する\nｇ．行為者の誤信が相当と認められる\nｈ．結果発生をもたらす仮定的事実が存在し得た\nｉ．結果不発生の原因を解明できた場合、すべて不能犯となる"}],"sub_questions":[],"requires_context":true,"choices":[{"number":1,"text":"①ａ ②ｃ ③ｅ ④ｇ ⑤ｈ","blanks":[{"blank":1,"word":"ａ"},{"blank":2,"word":"ｃ"},{"blank":3,"word":"ｅ"},{"blank":4,"word":"ｇ"},{"blank":5,"word":"ｈ"}]},{"number":2,"text":"①ａ ②ｄ ③ｆ ④ｉ ⑤ｈ","blanks":[{"blank":1,"word":"ａ"},{"blank":2,"word":"ｄ"},{"blank":3,"word":"ｆ"},{"blank":4,"word":"ｉ"},{"blank":5,"word":"ｈ"}]},{"number":3,"text":"①ａ ②ｅ ③ｆ ④ｃ ⑤ｇ","blanks":[{"blank":1,"word":"ａ"},{"blank":2,"word":"ｅ"},{"blank":3,"word":"ｆ"},{"blank":4,"word":"ｃ"},{"blank":5,"word":"ｇ"}]},{"number":4,"text":"①ｂ ②ｄ ③ｅ ④ｉ ⑤ｇ","blanks":[{"blank":1,"word":"ｂ"},{"blank":2,"word":"ｄ"},{"blank":3,"word":"ｅ"},{"blank":4,"word":"ｉ"},{"blank":5,"word":"ｇ"}]},{"number":5,"text":"①ｂ ②ｉ ③ｆ ④ｃ ⑤ｇ","blanks":[{"blank":1,"word":"ｂ"},{"blank":2,"word":"ｉ"},{"blank":3,"word":"ｆ"},{"blank":4,"word":"ｃ"},{"blank":5,"word":"ｇ"}]}],"answer_slots":[{"no":11,"official_answer":2}],"scoring":{"partial_credit":null,"no_partial_credit":false,"raw_note":""},"status":{"voided":false,"all_correct":false,"errata":[]},"statements":[],"statement_truth_derivable":false,"provenance":{"question_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_問題.pdf","answer_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_正答.pdf","page":8,"line_range":[223,261],"extraction":"pdftotext"},"flags":[]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q10","exam":{"type":"yobi","year":2023,"era":"R05"},"subject":"keiho","number":10,"points":2,"format":"single_choice","polarity":null,"exhaustive":false,"unordered":false,"stem":"次の１から５までの各事例における甲の罪責について判例の立場に従って検討した場合、甲に窃盗罪が成立しないものはどれか。（解答欄は、［№12］）","context":[],"sub_questions":[],"requires_context":false,"choices":[],"answer_slots":[{"no":12,"official_answer":5}],"scoring":{"partial_credit":null,"no_partial_credit":false,"raw_note":""},"status":{"voided":false,"all_correct":false,"errata":[]},"statements":["yobi-2023-keiho-q10-1","yobi-2023-keiho-q10-2","yobi-2023-keiho-q10-3","yobi-2023-keiho-q10-4","yobi-2023-keiho-q10-5"],"statement_truth_derivable":false,"provenance":{"question_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_問題.pdf","answer_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_正答.pdf","page":9,"line_range":[263,278],"extraction":"pdftotext"},"flags":[]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q11","exam":{"type":"yobi","year":2023,"era":"R05"},"subject":"keiho","number":11,"points":2,"format":"combination","polarity":"correct","exhaustive":false,"unordered":false,"stem":"次のアからオまでの各記述を判例の立場に従って検討した場合、正しいものの組合せは、後記１から５までのうちどれか。（解答欄は、［№13］）","context":[],"sub_questions":[],"requires_context":false,"choices":[{"number":1,"text":"ア イ","labels":["ア","イ"]},{"number":2,"text":"ア ウ","labels":["ア","ウ"]},{"number":3,"text":"イ オ","labels":["イ","オ"]},{"number":4,"text":"ウ エ","labels":["ウ","エ"]},{"number":5,"text":"エ オ","labels":["エ","オ"]}],"answer_slots":[{"no":13,"official_answer":4}],"scoring":{"partial_credit":null,"no_partial_credit":false,"raw_note":""},"status":{"voided":false,"all_correct":false,"errata":[]},"statements":["yobi-2023-keiho-q11-a","yobi-2023-keiho-q11-b","yobi-2023-keiho-q11-c","yobi-2023-keiho-q11-d","yobi-2023-keiho-q11-e"],"statement_truth_derivable":true,"provenance":{"question_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_問題.pdf","answer_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_正答.pdf","page":9,"line_range":[279,300],"extraction":"pdftotext"},"flags":[]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q12","exam":{"type":"yobi","year":2023,"era":"R05"},"subject":"keiho","number":12,"points":2,"format":"single_choice","polarity":"correct","exhaustive":false,"unordered":false,"stem":"偽証罪に関する次の１から５までの各記述を判例の立場に従って検討した場合、正しいものはどれか。（解答欄は、［№14］）","context":[{"kind":"参照条文","text":"刑事訴訟法\n第１５５条 宣誓の趣旨を理解することができない者は、宣誓をさせないで、これを尋問しなければならない。２ （略）"}],"sub_questions":[],"requires_context":true,"choices":[],"answer_slots":[{"no":14,"official_answer":5}],"scoring":{"partial_credit":null,"no_partial_credit":false,"raw_note":""},"status":{"voided":false,"all_correct":false,"errata":[]},"statements":["yobi-2023-keiho-q12-1","yobi-2023-keiho-q12-2","yobi-2023-keiho-q12-3","yobi-2023-keiho-q12-4","yobi-2023-keiho-q12-5"],"statement_truth_derivable":true,"provenance":{"question_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_問題.pdf","answer_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_正答.pdf","page":10,"line_range":[302,325],"extraction":"pdftotext"},"flags":[]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q13","exam":{"type":"yobi","year":2023,"era":"R05"},"subject":"keiho","number":13,"points":4,"format":"true_false_each","polarity":null,"exhaustive":false,"unordered":false,"stem":"次の【事例】に関する後記アからオまでの各【記述】を判例の立場に従って検討し、正しい場合には１を、誤っている場合には２を選びなさい。（解答欄は、アからオの順に［№15］から［№19］）","context":[{"kind":"事例","text":"甲は、高齢女性Ａから同人名義のキャッシュカード（以下「カード」という。）を不正に入手するため、甲が警察官を装いＡに電話をかけ、これからＡ方を訪れる警察官の確認を受けながらカードを封筒に入れ、同封筒をＡ方において保管する必要があるとうそを言い、警察官に成り済ました乙（２５歳、男性）がＡ方を訪れ、隙を見て同封筒を別の封筒とすり替えて持ち去り、カードを丙に渡して甲に届けさせる計画（以下「本件計画」という。）を考え、乙に本件計画の実行を指示し、乙はこれを承諾した。某日午前９時頃、本件計画に基づき、甲がＡに電話をかけて上記うそを言い、乙は、同日午前９時１５分頃、Ａ方を訪ね、Ａにカードを封筒に入れるよう求めた。しかし、乙の態度を不審に思ったＡが、乙に身分証の提示を求めたので、乙は、逮捕を免れるとともに本件計画どおりにカードを手に入れるため、Ａを手拳で多数回殴り、恐怖で抵抗できないＡからカードを奪って持ち去った。同日午前９時２０分頃、乙は、甲に電話で、本件計画どおりカードを入手したと伝えた。同日午前９時３０分頃、甲は、丙に電話をかけ、本件計画の内容を初めて説明し、乙からカードを受け取って甲に届けるよう依頼し、丙はこれを承諾した。丙は、同日午前１１時頃、乙と合流し、カードを受け取って乙と別れ、自動車でＡ方から約５０キロメートル離れた甲方に向かったが、同日午後０時３０分頃、甲方付近で降車した際、制服警察官ＢからＡ方での事件とは関係なく職務質問を受けた。その際、丙は、Ｂを殴り、Ｂに全治２週間を要する打撲傷を負わせ、その隙に上記自動車で逃走し、同日午後１時頃、甲と合流して甲にカードを届けた。その後、丙の交際相手丁は、丙が上記一連の犯行を行い、警察から捜査されていることを認識しつつ、丙を丁の自宅にかくまった。"}],"sub_questions":[],"requires_context":true,"choices":[],"answer_slots":[{"no":15,"official_answer":2,"statement_label":"ア"},{"no":16,"official_answer":2,"statement_label":"イ"},{"no":17,"official_answer":2,"statement_label":"ウ"},{"no":18,"official_answer":1,"statement_label":"エ"},{"no":19,"official_answer":2,"statement_label":"オ"}],"scoring":{"partial_credit":{"correct_needed":4,"points":2},"no_partial_credit":false,"raw_note":"４問正解で部分点２点"},"status":{"voided":false,"all_correct":false,"errata":[]},"statements":["yobi-2023-keiho-q13-a","yobi-2023-keiho-q13-b","yobi-2023-keiho-q13-c","yobi-2023-keiho-q13-d","yobi-2023-keiho-q13-e"],"statement_truth_derivable":true,"provenance":{"question_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_問題.pdf","answer_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R05-2023/刑法刑事訴訟法_正答.pdf","page":11,"line_range":[327,364],"extraction":"pdftotext"},"flags":[]}],"statements":[{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q01-a","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q01","label":"ア","text":"相手方の眼前に抜き身の日本刀を突き付けたとしても、その刃が同人に接触しない限り、暴行罪が成立することはない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[14,15]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q01-b","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q01","label":"イ","text":"相手方の意思に反して、その耳元で楽器を大音量で鳴らし続けた場合には、人の身体に対して不法な攻撃を加えたものとして暴行罪が成立し得る。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[16,17]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q01-c","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q01","label":"ウ","text":"ひそかに相手方に睡眠薬を摂取させ、２時間にわたり意識を失わせるとともに筋弛緩作用を伴う急性薬物中毒の症状を生じさせたとしても、覚醒後の健康状態に支障がない場合には、傷害罪が成立することはない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[18,20]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q01-d","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q01","label":"エ","text":"性病を有する者が、性行為を行えば相手方に感染させる危険性があると認識しながら、情を秘して同人と性行為を行い、同人に性病を感染させたとしても、同人が性行為に同意している場合には、傷害罪が成立することはない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[21,23]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q01-e","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q01","label":"オ","text":"相手方に暴行を加えて負傷させた者が、傷害結果が発生することについて認識を欠いている場合には、傷害罪が成立することはない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[24,25]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q02-1","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q02","label":"１","text":"【判旨】を前提にすると、殺意を有する者と傷害の故意にとどまる者との間で共謀共同正犯が成立する余地はない。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"multi_select_unordered","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":2,"official_answer":1},{"no":3,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[41,42]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q02-2","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q02","label":"２","text":"【判旨】は、共同正犯の成立には、実行行為の一部を分担することは必要ないとの立場に立っている。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"multi_select_unordered","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":2,"official_answer":1},{"no":3,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[43,44]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q02-3","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q02","label":"３","text":"【判旨】は、共謀共同正犯の成立には、単に関与者の内心における意思の合致があるだけでは十分でなく、客観的な謀議行為が必要であるとする考えと矛盾しない。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"multi_select_unordered","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":2,"official_answer":1},{"no":3,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[45,46]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q02-4","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q02","label":"４","text":"【判旨】に対しては、共同正犯を教唆及び幇助と区別することが困難になるとの批判がある。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"multi_select_unordered","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":2,"official_answer":1},{"no":3,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[47,47]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q02-5","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q02","label":"５","text":"【判旨】を前提にすると、共謀共同正犯の成立には、実行行為を行わない者が実行行為者に対して指揮命令をすることが必要である。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"multi_select_unordered","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":2,"official_answer":1},{"no":3,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[48,49]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q04-1","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q04","label":"１","text":"甲は、違法な麻薬の購入資金としてＡから預かった金銭の返還を免れるために、殺意をもって、Ａを殺害し、その返還を免れた。この場合、甲に強盗殺人罪が成立する。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":5,"official_answer":2}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[101,102]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q04-2","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q04","label":"２","text":"甲は、強盗目的でＡ宅に侵入し、殺意をもって、Ａを殺害して金品を奪うとともに、Ａの傍らで熟睡していた幼児Ｂも、殺意をもって、殺害した。この場合、Ａの殺害についてのみ、甲に強盗殺人罪が成立する。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":5,"official_answer":2}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[103,105]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q04-3","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q04","label":"３","text":"甲は、タクシーに乗車して目的地に到着した後、運賃を請求された際、運賃の支払を免れるために、タクシー運転手Ａにナイフを突き付けた上、「殺すぞ。」と言って脅し、Ａが恐怖で動けないうちに逃走し、その支払を免れた。この場合、甲に強盗罪が成立する。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":5,"official_answer":2}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[106,108]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q04-4","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q04","label":"４","text":"甲は、財物奪取目的でＡに包丁を突き付けて「金を出さなければ殺す。」と言って脅したところ、Ａに包丁をつかまれたため、Ａが負傷することを分かりながら包丁を引き、Ａは両手を負傷した。この場合、甲に強盗傷人罪が成立する。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":5,"official_answer":2}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[109,111]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q04-5","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q04","label":"５","text":"甲は、財物奪取目的でＡを脅迫してその反抗を抑圧し、その際、Ａが気付かないうちに、Ａが持つかばんから財布を抜き取った。この場合、甲に強盗罪が成立する。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":5,"official_answer":2}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[112,113]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q05-a","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q05","label":"ア","text":"緊急避難は、自己又は他人の生命、身体、自由又は財産という個人的法益に対する現在の危難を避けるためにした行為に成立するものであるから、国家的法益に対する危難を避けるためにした行為に緊急避難が成立することはない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"combination","basis":"convention","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":6,"official_answer":3}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[119,121]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2023-keiho-q12-a","exam":"司法","era":"R05","year":2023,"number":12,"label":"ア"}]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q05-b","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q05","label":"イ","text":"避難行為により避けようとした害の程度が生じた害の程度を上回る場合だけでなく、両者が同程度の場合にも、緊急避難は成立し得る。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"combination","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":6,"official_answer":3}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[122,123]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2023-keiho-q12-b","exam":"司法","era":"R05","year":2023,"number":12,"label":"イ"}]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q05-c","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q05","label":"ウ","text":"緊急避難における現在の危難は、危難が現に存在している場合のみならず、間近に押し迫っている場合も含む。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"combination","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":6,"official_answer":3}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[124,125]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2023-keiho-q12-c","exam":"司法","era":"R05","year":2023,"number":12,"label":"ウ"}]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q05-d","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q05","label":"エ","text":"過剰避難が成立する場合、情状によって、その刑を減軽することはできるが免除することはできない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"combination","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":6,"official_answer":3}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[126,127]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2023-keiho-q12-d","exam":"司法","era":"R05","year":2023,"number":12,"label":"エ"}]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q05-e","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q05","label":"オ","text":"緊急避難におけるやむを得ずにした行為とは、正当防衛におけるのと同様に、手段として必要最小限度のものであること、すなわち相当性を有するものであれば足りる。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"combination","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":6,"official_answer":3}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[128,129]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2023-keiho-q12-e","exam":"司法","era":"R05","year":2023,"number":12,"label":"オ"}]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q06-1","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q06","label":"１","text":"人が居住する木造建物Ａと人が居住していない木造建物Ｂは、木造の渡り廊下で接合され、渡り廊下を通じて人の行き来のある構造となっていた。甲は、これらの事実を認識した上で、その当時誰もいなかった建物Ｂに放火して建物Ｂを焼損した。この場合、建物Ａに延焼しなければ、甲に現住建造物等放火既遂罪が成立することはない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"multi_select_unordered","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":7,"official_answer":3},{"no":8,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[139,142]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2023-keiho-q08-1","exam":"司法","era":"R05","year":2023,"number":8,"label":"１"}]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q06-2","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q06","label":"２","text":"甲は、Ｖがその家族と共に居住する木造家屋に放火してこれを焼損した。この場合、Ｖとその家族が１泊２日の旅行中で不在であり、甲がそのことを認識して放火したのであれば、甲に現住建造物等放火既遂罪が成立することはない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"multi_select_unordered","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":7,"official_answer":3},{"no":8,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[143,145]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2023-keiho-q08-2","exam":"司法","era":"R05","year":2023,"number":8,"label":"２"}]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q06-3","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q06","label":"３","text":"甲は、妻と二人で居住する木造家屋を燃やそうと考え、壁に掛けられたカレンダーに火をつけた。この場合、上記カレンダーが焼損した時点で、これに気付いた妻に火を消し止められ、他に燃え移らなかったのであれば、甲に現住建造物等放火既遂罪が成立することはない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"multi_select_unordered","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":7,"official_answer":3},{"no":8,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[146,148]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2023-keiho-q08-3","exam":"司法","era":"R05","year":2023,"number":8,"label":"３"}]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q06-4","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q06","label":"４","text":"甲は、火災保険金を詐取する目的で、自己が単独で居住し、かつ、誰も現在しない木造家屋に放火してこれを焼損した。この場合、刑法第１０８条の「現に人が住居に使用し又は現に人がいる」の「人」に犯人は含まれないから、甲に現住建造物等放火既遂罪が成立することはない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"multi_select_unordered","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":7,"official_answer":3},{"no":8,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[149,152]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2023-keiho-q08-4","exam":"司法","era":"R05","year":2023,"number":8,"label":"４"}]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q06-5","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q06","label":"５","text":"甲は、Ｖが居住する木造家屋の押し入れの床にガソリンをまいて火をつけたところ、同押し入れの床板が独立して燃焼するに至ったが、他に燃え移る前に消し止められた。この場合、上記家屋の効用を失うに至っていなければ、甲に現住建造物等放火既遂罪が成立することはない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"multi_select_unordered","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":7,"official_answer":3},{"no":8,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[153,155]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2023-keiho-q08-5","exam":"司法","era":"R05","year":2023,"number":8,"label":"５"}]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q08-1","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q08","label":"１","text":"賭博罪が成立するためには、賭博行為が開始されるだけでなく、勝敗が決し、金品の授受がなされなければならない。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":10,"official_answer":3}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[198,199]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q08-2","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q08","label":"２","text":"あるスポーツの勝敗に関し、あらかじめ勝敗の結果を知った上、その結果を知らない者との間で金銭を賭けて利益を得た場合、当事者全員に賭博罪が成立する。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":10,"official_answer":3}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[200,201]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q08-3","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q08","label":"３","text":"一般多数人をして、スポーツの勝敗に関し、賭博をさせて利益を得るため、賭博の主催者が、参加者を特定の場所に集めることなく、事務所の固定電話を利用して参加者と連絡を取り合って賭博をさせた場合であっても、賭博場開張図利罪が成立する。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":10,"official_answer":3}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[202,204]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q08-4","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q08","label":"４","text":"それまで賭博行為をしたことがなかった甲が、長期間営業を継続する意思で多額の資金を投下して多数の賭博遊技機を設置した遊技場の営業を開始し、来場した多数の遊技者と賭博行為をしたとしても、数日間営業を行ったにすぎない場合には、甲に常習賭博罪が成立することはない。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":10,"official_answer":3}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[205,208]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q08-5","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q08","label":"５","text":"賭博常習者の賭博行為を常習性のない者が幇助した場合、常習性のない者には常習賭博罪の幇助犯が成立する。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":10,"official_answer":3}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[209,210]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q10-1","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q10","label":"１","text":"甲は、Ｖ宅内において、Ｖが所在を見失っていたＶ所有の指輪を発見し、これを自己のものにしようと考えて無断で持ち去った。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[266,267]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q10-2","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q10","label":"２","text":"甲は、Ｖが海中に取り落としたＶ所有の金塊について、Ｖからおおよその落下場所を教えてもらった上で回収を依頼され、Ｖの眼前で同所に潜り、同金塊を同所付近で発見したものの、これを自己のものにしようと考えて無断で持ち去った。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[268,270]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q10-3","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q10","label":"３","text":"甲は、看守者のいない仏堂に所有者Ｖが据え置いてまつっていた仏像を、自己のものにしようと考えて無断で持ち去った。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[271,272]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q10-4","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q10","label":"４","text":"甲は、Ⅴが乙から窃取した乙所有の腕時計を、これが盗品であることを知りながら自己のものにしようと考えて、Ⅴ宅に忍び込んで無断で持ち去った。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[273,274]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q10-5","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q10","label":"５","text":"甲は、満員電車内において、乗客Ｖが網棚にかばんを置き忘れたままＡ駅で下車したのを目撃し、Ｂ駅で下車する際、同かばんを自己のものにしようと考えて無断で持ち去った。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[275,276]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q11-a","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q11","label":"ア","text":"甲は、Ａが居住するＡ所有の家屋に放火し、同家屋を全焼させた上、同家屋に隣接するＢが居住するＢ所有の家屋にも火を燃え移らせて同家屋を全焼させた。この場合、甲には２個の現住建造物等放火罪が成立し、これらは観念的競合となる。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"combination","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":13,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[282,284]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2023-keiho-q05-a","exam":"司法","era":"R05","year":2023,"number":5,"label":"ア"}]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q11-b","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q11","label":"イ","text":"甲は、行使の目的で１万円札を偽造し、Ａが経営する商店において、事情を知らないＡに対し、１万円の商品の購入を申し込み、その代金として偽造の１万円札をＡに手渡して同商品の交付を受けた。この場合、甲には通貨偽造罪、偽造通貨行使罪及び詐欺罪が成立し、これらは牽連犯となる。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"combination","basis":"convention","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":13,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[285,288]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2023-keiho-q05-b","exam":"司法","era":"R05","year":2023,"number":5,"label":"イ"}]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q11-c","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q11","label":"ウ","text":"暴力団員甲及び乙は、対立する暴力団員Ａ及びＢを襲撃して殺害することを共謀し、路上を連れ立って歩いていたＡ及びＢを待ち構えた上で、甲がＡを、乙がＢを、それぞれ殺害した。この場合、甲及び乙を共同正犯とする２個の殺人罪が成立し、これらは併合罪となる。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"combination","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":13,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[289,291]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2023-keiho-q05-c","exam":"司法","era":"R05","year":2023,"number":5,"label":"ウ"}]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q11-d","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q11","label":"エ","text":"甲は、酒に酔った状態で、自動車を無免許で運転した。この場合、甲には酒酔い運転の罪と無免許運転の罪が成立し、これらは観念的競合となる。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"combination","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":13,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[292,293]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2023-keiho-q05-d","exam":"司法","era":"R05","year":2023,"number":5,"label":"エ"}]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q11-e","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q11","label":"オ","text":"甲は、恐喝目的でＡを監禁し、監禁のための暴行等により畏怖しているＡを更に脅迫して現金を喝取した。この場合、監禁罪と恐喝罪が成立し、これらは牽連犯となる。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"combination","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":13,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[294,295]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2023-keiho-q05-e","exam":"司法","era":"R05","year":2023,"number":5,"label":"オ"}]},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q12-1","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q12","label":"１","text":"自己が被告人となっている窃盗被告事件につき、知人を教唆して偽証行為を行わせた場合、他人の行為を利用して自ら虚偽を述べたに等しく、被告人が自己の刑事事件につき虚偽を述べても罪にならないから、偽証罪の教唆犯は成立しない。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":14,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[305,307]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q12-2","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q12","label":"２","text":"証人が殊更記憶に反する陳述をした場合、その他の証拠からその陳述内容が真実と認められるのであれば、国の審判作用は害されないから、偽証罪は成立しない。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":14,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[308,309]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q12-3","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q12","label":"３","text":"共犯者が被告人となっている詐欺被告事件に証人として出廷し、証言拒絶権を行使せずに宣誓して自己の犯罪事実に関して虚偽の陳述をした場合、同証人には自己負罪拒否特権があるから、偽証罪は成立しない。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":14,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[310,312]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q12-4","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q12","label":"４","text":"証人がした虚偽の陳述が裁判の結果に影響しなかった場合、国の審判作用に対する具体的な危険が発生しなかったといえるから、偽証罪は成立しない。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":14,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[313,314]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q12-5","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q12","label":"５","text":"「宣誓の趣旨を理解することができない者」（刑事訴訟法第１５５条第１項）に誤って証人として宣誓させた上、その者が虚偽の陳述をした場合、偽証罪の「宣誓」は適法になされなければならないから、同罪は成立しない。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":14,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[315,317]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q13-a","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q13","label":"ア","text":"乙がＡからカードを奪った行為は、窃盗罪の実行に着手した後、Ａに暴行を加えてこれを奪取したことになるから、乙に事後強盗既遂罪が成立する。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"true_false_each","basis":"direct","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":15,"official_answer":2}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[351,352]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q13-b","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q13","label":"イ","text":"甲が乙のＡに対する暴行・脅迫を認識も予見もしていなかった場合、乙がＡからカードを奪取した行為について、甲に窃盗未遂罪の共同正犯が成立するにとどまる。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"true_false_each","basis":"direct","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":16,"official_answer":2}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[353,354]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q13-c","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q13","label":"ウ","text":"甲は、当初から丙にカードを運搬させる計画であり、その運搬は重要な役割であるから、丙には盗品等運搬罪ではなく窃盗罪の共同正犯が成立する。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"true_false_each","basis":"direct","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":17,"official_answer":2}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[355,356]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q13-d","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q13","label":"エ","text":"丙がＢを殴って負傷させた行為には、公務執行妨害罪と傷害罪が成立し、これらは観念的競合となる。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"true_false_each","basis":"direct","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":18,"official_answer":1}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[357,358]}},{"id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q13-e","question_id":"yobi-2023-keiho-q13","label":"オ","text":"丙のいずれの行為についても、証拠上、犯罪の嫌疑が不十分として不起訴となった場合、丁が丙をかくまった行為について犯人蔵匿罪は成立しない。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"true_false_each","basis":"direct","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":19,"official_answer":2}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[359,360]}}],"explanations":[]}